On Thursday, 25 April 2019 14.56.44 EDT Mike S. wrote:
> i lo bicrbombu cu se bevri mi o'adai lo mamta be mi vau
> SENTT DET bee-CLZ-Bombus VPZ INV carry 1 proudly-OBV DET mother INAL 1 VP=
